acceptance_criteria: Same-length history rewrites invalidate cached event results; SDK event readers expose explicit integrity semantics and a strict authoritative-chain verification option; Existing non-Git connector consumers can use the public contract without raw-path verification; Positive and corrupted-history controls cover process-local and restarted index reads
parent: pm-o2kc
risk: high
confidence: 85
expected_result: Event consumers can require authoritative verified history with explicit integrity receipts and content-sensitive cache validity.
actual_result: Reporter demonstrates a same-length record_hash rewrite remains hidden by the history-event index on2026.10.25. Implementation is queued.
